==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# A person who gives [[lecture]]s, especially as a [[profession]].
# A member of a [[university]] or [[college]] below the [[rank]] of [[assistant professor]] or [[reader]].
# {{dated}} A member of the [[Church of England]] [[clergy]] whose main task was to deliver [[sermon]]s (''[[lecture]]s'') in the afternoons and evenings.

